   "beats": [
    {
     "day": 160,
     "text": "🥣 Sanne of The Red Table walks into your firelight alone, thinner than you remember. \"Our jars are empty,\" they say. No preamble. \"I'm asking for food.\""
    },
    {
     "day": 160,
     "text": "⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."
    },
    {
     "day": 160,
     "text": "🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northeast. They carried off ~800 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"
    },
    {
     "day": 161,
     "text": "📡 The world feed: The Bloodied — a harvest festival. The chat has opinions."
    },
    {
     "day": 161,
     "text": "⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."
    },
    {
     "day": 161,
     "text": "🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the south. They carried off ~400 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"
    },
    {
     "day": 162,
     "text": "Sanne waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Red Table with nothing. They'll remember the silence."
    },
